%% Query flow: retrieve, assemble a grounded prompt, stream a cited answer.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Streamlit UI
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant E as Embedder
    participant S as Vector store
    participant L as LLM

    U->>UI: ask a question
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/query/stream
    API->>E: embed(question)
    E-->>API: query vector
    API->>S: search(top-k)
    S-->>API: relevant chunks (+ scores)
    Note over API: assemble grounded prompt<br/>system-prompt isolation + injection guards
    API->>L: stream(system, prompt)
    L-->>API: answer tokens…
    API-->>UI: SSE events: meta, sources, token, done
    UI-->>U: streamed answer with [n] citations
